 "description": "Canal House is a brand-new collection of thoughtfully designed rental residences set along a quiet, tree-lined stretch of the neighborhood. Each apartment pairs an open, light-filled layout with warm natural finishes, oversized windows, and generous closet space, creating a calm and flexible backdrop for everyday living.\n\nResidences\n\nHomes feature open island kitchens with paneled appliances, quartz countertops, and wide-plank flooring throughout. Spa-inspired bathrooms, in-unit washer and dryers, and central heating and cooling come standard, while select layouts add private balconies and skyline outlooks.\n\nAmenities\n\nResidents enjoy an attended lobby, a landscaped roof deck, a fully equipped fitness center, a resident lounge with a work-from-home space, on-site parking, and secure package and bike rooms. Thoughtful service and a welcoming community round out the experience.\n\nIdeally located near multiple subway lines, Canal House places parks, restaurants, and everyday conveniences just steps from your door. Pricing reflects a net effective rent; please inquire for current availability, lease terms, and any move-in incentives.",
